        "Dictionary",
        "Easton.",
        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>ESAIAS</strong> the Greek form for Isaiah, constantly used in the Authorized Version of the New Testament (Matthew 3:3; 4:14), but in the Revised Version always “Isaiah.”",
