        "Tewahedo — Cyril of Alexandria",
        "Cyril of Alexandria (430).",
        '<aside class="note-comm-ethiopian"><strong>Cyril of Alexandria</strong> <em>Commentary on Matthew</em> <small>(c. 430 AD)</small><p>&#x27;Blessed are the peacemakers; for they shall be called sons of God&#x27; — Cyril sees the divine-likeness in eirenopoioi (peace-MAKERS, not merely peace-keepers). To make peace is to imitate the Father who reconciles in the Son. The huioi-status is conferred precisely by Christic peacemaking.</p></aside>',
