        "Easton.",
        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>HEROD ANTIPAS</strong> Herod’s son by Malthace (Matthew 14:1; Luke 3:1, 19; 9:7; Acts 13:1). (See ANTIPAS.)",
        "Easton's Illustrated Bible Dictionary, M. G. Easton (1897). Public domain.",
