        "g",
        "",
        "dict-easton",
        "Dictionary",
        "Easton.",
        "<strong>Dictionary (Easton's).</strong> <strong>BAR-JONA</strong> son of Jonah, the patronymic of Peter (Matthew 16:17; John 1:42), because his father’s name was Jonas. (See PETER.)",
